## defuddle — `cortex-readability.js`

The content-extraction heuristics in `cortex-readability.js` are derived from the
design of **defuddle** (Kepano). The implementation in this repository is an
independent rewrite using only the Node.js standard library — no defuddle code is
vendored and no defuddle dependency is installed — but the scoring approach,
content-entry-point selector order, negative/positive class-token lists, and the
relax-then-retry strategy are adapted from it.

